                "claim": "verdictObject indexes the verifier delta at [2] without checking its length. If the delta has fewer than three lines, the test panics with an index-out-of-range error instead of reporting a clear assertion failure. TestReviewerAndVerifierDeltasAreTheLinesOfTheReviewerDesign pins the line count, so the practical risk is low, but the helper's failure mode is unclear.",
