                "severity": "SUGGESTION",
                "claim": "TestVerifierDeltaObjectIsTheOneTheEngineParses checks only the accepted path: every result/base_result pair is parsed with legal values. It does not check that the parser refuses a pair the delta says is illegal, such as command empty when a check ran. The prompt-level rules are pinned only as substring presence in the delta, so a drift between prompt prose and parser refusals is not caught here. The parser's own tests cover the refusals.",
